  "ward": "Marlborough",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-06T09:58:53.730Z",
  "street_name": "Headstone Road",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The proposed roof extension, on top of the existing outrigger, would result in an addition that is unduly obtrusive and incongruous addition to the original building, failing to respect its character and proportions, and the visual amenities of the locality. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the high-quality design aspiration of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D1, D3, D4 of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041) and the relevant provisions of the adopted Harrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
